/// @defgroup app Application
/// Entry point and top-level scenes: Game owns the menu/in-world scene
/// switch, MainMenuScene drives the title screen, MainScene wires the
/// gameplay collaborators together for one frame.

/// @defgroup world World & Voxels
/// Chunk storage, meshing, rendering, generation, and voxel queries: the
/// block grid, its GPU mesh pipeline, terrain/noise generation, the atlas,
/// and raycast/collision queries against it.

/// @defgroup persistence Persistence
/// World save/load: on-disk region/world-meta formats and the orchestration
/// that drains live state into them and back.

/// @defgroup player Player
/// Player movement/collision glue and block break/place interaction.

/// @defgroup ui UI
/// In-game ImGui-backed panels: HUD, settings, and hotbar.
